---
const SIGNUP_URL = 'https://go.marginapp.in';
const tags = ['One financial year at a time', 'Ex-date kept', 'Counted in XIRR', 'Delete by stock and year'];
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden bg-navy-800/20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="reveal order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="relative rounded-xl border border-border bg-navy-800/60 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold-400/30 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">Dividends On Record</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4">
              {[
                { label: 'Net received', value: '₹2.41L', gold: true },
                { label: 'Paying stocks', value: '34' },
                { label: 'Payouts recorded', value: '128' },
                { label: 'Years covered', value: '7', sub: 'FY 2019-20 to FY 2025-26' },
              ].map((stat) => (
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-navy-950/50 border border-border/60 p-4">
                  <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1">{stat.label}</p>
                  <p class={`font-display text-2xl font-semibold ${stat.gold ? 'text-gold-400' : 'text-cream'}`}>{stat.value}</p>
                  {stat.sub && <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{stat.sub}</p>}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-navy-950/50 border border-border/60 p-4 mb-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-3">FY 2025-26, most recent payouts</p>
              <div class="space-y-2">
                {[
                  { symbol: 'COFORGE', date: '03 Aug 2026', amount: '₹1,160' },
                  { symbol: 'CANTABIL', date: '20 Feb 2026', amount: '₹2,018' },
                  { symbol: 'SAREGAMA', date: '11 Nov 2025', amount: '₹14,580' },
                ].map((row) => (
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                    <span class="text-ink">{row.symbol}</span>
                    <span class="text-muted">ex-date {row.date}</span>
                    <span class="text-cream font-medium">{row.amount}</span>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-navy-950/60 border border-amber-400/25 p-4 flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-1.5 shrink-0"></span>
              <span class="text-xs text-muted">
                2 rows name a stock we could not match. Pick them and the year is recorded; until then nothing is written.
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="text-xs text-gold-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Dividends</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-cream leading-tight mb-6">
          Dividends belong<br />
          <em class="font-semibold not-italic">in your return</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Upload the dividend statement for one financial year and Margin keeps a payout per stock
          per ex-date, with the ex-date held as the day the cash arrived. A stock that paid twice
          in a year stays two payouts with their own dates.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Each payout then counts as cash returned on that date, in the XIRR of the stock and of the
          whole portfolio. A year you have not uploaded understates your return by whatever it paid,
          so Margin shows the years you hold before you read any return as settled.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
          When a row names a stock Margin cannot match, nothing is written and the year is left as it
          was. You pick the stock yourself and upload again, so a year never reads complete while
          quietly missing a holding.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8">
          {tags.map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted border border-border rounded-full">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted/80 mb-8">
          Zerodha dividend statements are read today. Send yours through the feedback button in the app
          and the format gets added.
        </p>
        <a
          href={SIGNUP_URL}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors group"
        >
          Record your dividends
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
